      "doc": "How the engine lays out view space: which way the camera faces along z, and with it the shape of the view and projection matrices. Independent of \u0060ke_ndc_convention\u0060, which reports the clip space of the device. Every slot is callable at any time. No slot\u0027s result is documented as constant; a consumer that caches one is making its own choice.",
